window.products.push({"id":854060,"name":"Baloo Pure French Linen Sheets - White Sheet Set (King) - Soft, Premium, Breathable, Made with Natural Chemical-Free Fibers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":289.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dS0VDgcJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classically Elegant: The luxury bed sheet sets are crafted from heirloom quality stonewashed French flax linen. Quality you can feel instantly. The king fitted sheet depth of 16 inches will be able to accommodate even deep mattresses. Complete Package: Each king bedsheet set includes a fitted sheet, flat sheet, and two pillowcases with envelope closure. King size sets include king size pillowcases. Each bedding set is covered by Baloo’s Lifetime Quality Guarantee. Stay Cool: The full size bedding is made with breathable and airy natural fibers that stay cool in the summer and help regulate sleeping temperatures in both warm and cool climates. Thread Count: Due to the size of the flax linen fibers, thread count is not used as a measure of linen's quality (unlike cotton). Instead, the tightness of the weave is indicated by the fabric weight. Baloo’s linen is 180 GSM, indicating a tight weave and premium fabric that will drape and breathe beautifully. Care Instructions: Machine wash with cool water using gentle detergent. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low and remove promptly. Iron on low heat if desired. For a softer experience, we recommend washing before first use. The linen will become even softer over time, without weakening the fabric, making it comfortable and looking new for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dS0VDgcJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baloo","source_asin":"B08XZ2ZH7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XZ2ZH7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XZ2ZH7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
