window.products.push({"id":854063,"name":"Tangkula Corner Desk, Corner Computer Desk, Corner Writing Desk with Drawer & Shelves, Space Saving Corner Desk, Corner Table for Home Apartment and O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717ZLFLAmjL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Description Are you still worried about not having a good corner desk? Our reddish-brown corner desk can help you better save space and storage things.The corner table is made of density board, which has the advantages of good quality and durability.This storage tower with five drawers, and make it easy to find and grab what you need right away. Removable drawers separate and organize clothing and accessories like hats, socks and scarves in one convenient place. The MDF board at the top is environmentally friendly material and reliable iron frames make you feel at ease to use this product. Humanized design is easy for you to use and move.The original intention of designing products is to better serve the people who use them. Our storage tower will help you better in your life. Feature The drawer with handle is designed with slide so you can easily take things out and closeFive removable drawers provide plenty of storage spaceCollapsible drawers are not only convenient for storing items, but also easy to remove and storeNot only will the plastic and adjustable feet not scratch your floor, it can also be placed smoothly on uneven groundEnvironmentally friendly material and strong iron frame are your best choiceSide handles for easy to carry and also prevent items from sliding down the topStorage tower can be placed in bedroom, living room or officeStorage tower saves you space to store clothes and can be used as an ornamentThe top of the MDF board is melamine veneer and PVC edge sealing Specification Color: Reddish BrownMaterial: Density BoardPaint: NC PaintDesktop Weight Capacity: 110LBSEach Shelf Weight Capacity: 11LBSDimension: 47''(L) x 23.5''(W) x 30''(H)Weight: 44.5LBSPackage Includes:1 x Corner Desk Accessories  1 x Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717ZLFLAmjL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B07WVZK34Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WVZK34Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WVZK34Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":854064,"name":"ECOMEX Nightstand with 4 Drawers, Black Nightstand Bedside Table with Fabric Bins Wood Top/Frame, Night Stands for Bedroom, Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+UcH+sxZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Size & Sufficient Storage】The size of our 4-drawer nightstand is 15.75\"L X 11.42\"W X29.13\"H. 4 easy-pull drawers also provide sufficient storage space for you. It can hold sundries, small toys, remote controls, charging cables, underwear, socks, knitting supplies, etc, and can place your favorite small objects on the desktop 【High-Quality Material & Construction】 This practical 4-drawer nightstand frame is made of 100% premium paulownia wood and a water-resistant wooden top, that can provide sturdy and stable support for the bedside table itself, and natural materials don't threaten the health of you and your family. Durable wood panels with high-quality linen fabric drawer which is more abrasion than non-woven fabrics, ensuring long-lasting durability 【Stylish Design & Foldable Drawers】Our bedside tables are superior craftsmanship, designed, and manufactured jointly by craftsmen from an experienced design team. Soft fabric drawers with reinforced bases that can be easily pulled or removed, open and close quietly when in use, and can be folded for storage when not in use, making them ideal for a variety of uses 【Multipurpose & Practical】This classic 4-drawer bedside table is available in 3 sizes and 2 colors for you to choose from, it can be used for many purposes and is also the perfect decoration, and it is ideal for placement in the living room, bedroom, stairs area, next to sofa and Kitchen Dining, etc. The overall combination of simple lines and modern style brings lasting elegance and charm to your homestands steadily, and will not shake under full load. The fabric drawers with reinforced bases have a better load capacity. Pads at the bottom are both slip-resistant and floor-protecting. 【Easy Assembly】We provides a very simple and easy-to-understand installation manual and all necessary accessories. If you encounter any problems during the assembly process, you can contact us for help, we will give you a satisfactory solution! I believe you will feel the accomplishment and fun of assembling during the installation process","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+UcH+sxZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECOMEX","source_asin":"B0BD2W972B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD2W972B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD2W972B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
