window.products.push({"id":854323,"name":"Home & Abode White & Brown Metal Bread Box for Kitchen Countertop | Rustic Farmhouse Kitchen Bread Container | Bread Storage Bin With Lid | Dining and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lBfcyzlXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TIRED OF STALE BREAD? Meet Bread's best friend. Here's the story: bread and box met at the farmhouse.....well, the rest is history. With this Bread box, \"storage\" and \"container \" are not words for the cabinet. You can proudly display it on your kitchen counter. Not only will your bread thank you, so will your Home. Our Stylish sleek design will complement any Kitchen; modern, rustic, vintage or traditional - it just fits right in. Sit back and watch as the compliments roll in. SPACE SAVER- Time is a precious thing, and so is space (not talking about where the moon is 😀). In this 13.25\" x 12.5\" x 7.5\" bread box you can neatly store 2 large loaves of bread, bagels, pastries, cookies, even snacks. Oh, and it's made of 100% durable premium quality, food safe material......Talk about \"Saving Space\". BE A BREAD HERO- Our breadboxes are uniquely designed- nicely sealed, while still allowing just the right amount of airflow for optimal freshness. Save generations of bread, 2 loaves at time! A TIME TO GIVE- Looking for the perfect housewarming, Mothers Day, (Wife's day?) or birthday gift? Why buy a Mercedes when you can give the gift of elegance, and style - that doesn't require an oil change. We call it the \"Mercedes of breadboxes\"! BUTTER YOU UP- Our customers mean the World to us! To express that, we included a complimentary butter dish. Fresh butter, fresh bread -I'm getting hungry..... At Home & Abode, our top priority is your satisfaction. We are pleased to offer our 100% satisfaction guarantee. If for any reason we have not met your expectations, please don't hesitate to contact our dedicated team -we’ll make it right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lBfcyzlXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOME & ABODE","source_asin":"B089SHH79G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089SHH79G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089SHH79G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
