window.products.push({"id":854328,"name":"Povinmos Portable Inflatable Airplanes Camping Tent Accessories, Premium Comfortable Travel Pillow for Body Head Neck Rest w/Eyes Mask- Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nUmIsvHpL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Only Premium Materials: 10+ years specializing in travel pillows, industry-leading. Inflatable travel pillow is made of environmental protection PVC flocking, feel comfortable, can be washed, no ball, no decolorization, no depilation, no plastic smell(think plastic beach ball), and sends out a faint jasmine scent. Easy to inflate and deflate: You can Easily Inflate travel pillows with a Few Breaths of Air, and Release the Air by Press One Button,They roll up nicely to fit back into travel bags Absolutely patended Airplanes Pillow: Ergonomic inflatable plane pillow helps circulate blood and relieve fatigue.More comfortable than Traditional Neck Pillow .With full support for your head and upper body, no more stiff neck, sore neck, sore shoulder caused by improper sleep posture. Multi-Use and Adjustable: Different Ways to Use inflatable travel pillow , Choose Your Most Comfortable Posture,Making it Easier to Relax, Fall Asleep, and Stay Asleep Longer.With Compact Carry Bag ,Portable to Take it for Long Flight, Cars, Buses, Trains, Office Napping, Camping. Unique Design Relax and Travel Comfortably in a Natural Forward Position, Allows You to Watch Movies or Play Games On Your Phone Within the Pillow! What you get: 1*Travel Pillow+1*3d Goggles. The 3D Goggles is made of high-quality milk silk fabric, Povinmos has designed an upgraded version of 3d Goggles for Povinmos' customer. The upgraded 3D Goggles is more space and the eyes have more space, which can better reduce pressure on the eyeball. Povinmos pays attention to every detail and strives to provide the best quality goods and services with our best efforts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nUmIsvHpL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Povinmos","source_asin":"B07PWM324T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PWM324T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PWM324T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
