window.products.push({"id":854331,"name":"Catch Me by Pat Saunders, 18 by 18-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MK9po2gZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features two white dogs. Instantly recognizable, the brilliant, saturated colors of Pat Saunders-White;s animal paintings have established her as a national pet portrait artist. Pat brings an element of spontaneity, boldness and humor into a genre that is often stiff and photo realistic. Pat's big 'Ah-Ha!' moment was when she painted her first animal. Fourteen year later, she still finds this an exciting niche. The first animal paintings in this new style and technique gave her a feeling of 'coming home' after a long journey. Pat participates in juried national shows and presents workshops in her home studio and various workshop venues. She donates her work annually to non-profit fundraisers. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MK9po2gZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00DNJ76BG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DNJ76BG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DNJ76BG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":854332,"name":"4-Pack Silicone Dehydrator Mats with Edge, 12x10.6inch Non-Stick Food Dehydrator Tray Liner Compatible with Cosori CP267-FD, Reusable Dehydrator Sheet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+B2pcn3kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Food Safe/Non-Toxic & Healthy】Dehydrator mats made from food-grade silicone material, non-stick, BPA-Free, heat-resistant(-40℃ to 230℃ / -40℉ to 446℉). The raised edge design prevents liquid from flowing out and is perfect for making baked goods, dehydrating eggs, canned peaches, fruit leathers, fruit roll-ups, beef jerky, and more. 【Reusable & Easy To Clean】Reusable dehydrator mat with non-stick coating on the surface, effectively avoiding the sticking of food residues such as beef jerky and Fruit on the tray. Just use warm soapy water hand-washed or cleaned in the dishwasher, then be rolled up and stored after use. 【Wide Compatibility】Silicone dehydrator mats measure 12'' × 10.6'', and apply to no less than 12'' × 13'' metal trays. ( You need to measure your trays to see if the mat fits inside your tray.) Compatible with Cosori CP267-FD, Excalibur, Chefman, BioChef Arizona, Magic Mill MFD-7070 Commercial, and more. 【Versatile Uses Meet All Your Needs】Prtyking dehydrator tray liner is not only for drier all types of vegetables, fruits, condiments, grains, herbs, meat, and pet food, but also a good choice for dehydrating liquidy foods, eggs, broth, tomato juice/paste. Extra silicone scrapers enable you to peel off food easily from silicone dehydrator trays, or as a spatula for mixing food. 【What You Get】4-Pack Silicone Dehydrator Mats with Edge, 2-Pack Silicone Dehydrator Mesh Sheets, 1-Pack Silicone Scraper. Don’t forget to buy this as a PERFECT GIFT for your family & friends. 【Welcome guide, Five Star Shopping Experience at Prtyking. Our worry-free 12-month warranty, and great customer service.】","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+B2pcn3kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prtyking","source_asin":"B0BCGZDQR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCGZDQR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCGZDQR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
