window.products.push({"id":854337,"name":"B’WELL 12 oz - Glass Travel Mug - Reusable Coffee Cup - To Go Coffee Mug - Silicone Lid & Base - Tea Travel Mug - Hot & Cold Drinks - Dishwasher & Mic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WyCLdDUmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"By using a glass reusable coffee mug you will prevent unnecessary plastic pollution and you will positively support the environment. Moreover, a reusable glass coffee cup looks way more stylish and elegant than disposable coffee cups and healthier than any other materials. Why is Borosilicate Glass better than regular glass? - Not all glass is created equally. The Borosilicate glass is thermal shock resistant - It will not become cloudy over time; the glass will be as clear as the day you bought it - It’s lighter than regular glass - The Glass will not produce condensation on the outer layer when filled with a cold beverage - It makes drinks taste better. When you use borosilicate glass the liquid inside remains pure, because borosilicate glass has low solubility, keeping your beverage contaminant free - In terms of overall performance, borosilicate glass is far superior to regular glass. Because of its durability and resistance to chemical changes, it has been traditionally used in chemistry labs as well as for kitchenware and premium glasses. Borosilicate glass is a significant upgrade from traditional glass, and because of its superior quality, it is often priced higher -For your drinking pleasure, our Double Wall Glass Cups are insulated to keep your drinks hot or cold for extended periods of time. In addition, the double wall glass structure ensures that the glass remains cool to touch! Beverages appear to float inside the inner layer of the clear glass. Moreover, the silicone lid & base are made up of 100% food-grade silicone, non-toxic and Eco-friendly with an attractive, ergonomic and practical design. An eco-friendly reusable glass cup is just one step we can take towards a smarter & more sustainable lifestyle. Replace your disposable single use cups, with the innovative B’WELL reusable travel cups! It is time to change the way you drink!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WyCLdDUmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"B'WELL","source_asin":"B077GS8NH5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077GS8NH5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077GS8NH5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":854338,"name":"Mikomer 2PCS Elegant Flower Magnetic Curtain Tiebacks Clips Holder Holdbacks Rope Tie Backs Buckle with Blingbling Artificial Crystals and Stretchable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715g-gY+vRL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Luxury and Delicate Design-European style flower with artificial diamonds which adds a beautiful view to your curtains,looks shinning under strong sunshine. Easy Application-No need to punch holes,easy to hold the curtains with two strong magnets and stretchable wire rope,this curtain holdback can be widely used on most curtains.When used on light curtain,please wrapped around twice to make it firm enough . High Quality Material-Plastic+Magnet+Rhinestone+Iron,strong and durable. Product Size-Stretchable Wire Rope(23cm/9in,can be stretched to about 40cm/15.7in ),Total length(37cm/14.5in),Flower Diameter(10cm/3.9in) 2PCS/package,best decoration idea for home and offce,also great gift for your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715g-gY+vRL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mikomer","source_asin":"B09M3VX3XN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M3VX3XN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M3VX3XN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
