window.products.push({"id":854344,"name":"VINMEN 5 Panel HD Print Movie Characters Canvas Painting Poster Wall Art Painting Home Decor Kids Room Bedroom Photo, 20X35 20X45 20X55 cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bd10oqzAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Material: Chemical fabric, cotton cloth and linenStyle: Modern/NordicPackage: Solid Packaging BagCraft: Art micro spray1.Is a framed included in this product?No, it is only canvas.2.How to clean the surface of canvas?The canvas is waterproof so you can clean it with moistened cloth but please do not wet the cloth too much.3.Can I customize the image?Yes. Any picture or painting you like can be printed onto the canvas, you only need to contact the seller and send the image in JEPG format. But it may take several days.1、As a professional art work supplier, We are dedicated to bringing customers the best selection of canvas wall art in the world. Our range of hundreds of thousands of hand painted oil paintings for sale and photo to canvas prints, make it simple and safe for customers to find a perfect paintings wall decorations for living room, bedroom, kitchen, office, Hotel, dining room, office, bathroom, bar.2、A perfect Christmas and New Year gifts for your relatives and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bd10oqzAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VINMEN","source_asin":"B07TB8JDT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TB8JDT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TB8JDT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":854345,"name":"The Pioneer Woman 1.7 Liter Vintage Floral Electric Kettle, Model 40970 by Hamilton Beach","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610FZl1qHHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tea or hot cocoa, anyone? Get boiled water fast with the Pioneer Woman Electric Kettle by Hamilton Beach. Bring the charming patterns of Fiona Floral or Vintage Floral straight from the countertop to the table with cord-free serving. And with 1.7 liter capacity, there?s enough for the whole family. The automatic shutoff feature with boil dry protection keeps the kettle from scorching. Cord-Free Serving. Bring the hot water right to your guests at your next brunch or book club. The kettle effortlessly lifts off the base for serving. Faster Than a Microwave. For those who need hot water fast, this electric kettle is for you. In minutes, you can have multiple cups of boiling water for serving French press coffee, tea, cocoa or instant oatmeal to friends and family. Removable Filter Included. An anti-scale mesh filter fits inside the spout and can be easily removed for cleaning. Pick Your Patterns. Inspired by her daily life on her family?s Oklahoma Ranch, Ree?s designs will brighten your table and countertops. Her style encourages mixing and matching to complement your individual taste in the kitchen. Meet Ree: Ree Drummond is a NY Times Best Selling Author, TV personality, social media phenom, and the woman behind the popular Pioneer Woman lifestyle blog that started it all. She?s also a lover of butter, basset hounds, Ethel Merman, her hunky, cowboy husband Ladd, and their four kids. Her casual country style and delicious recipes have made her a go-to for all things cooking and entertaining. Hamilton Beach products are thoughtfully designed to make your life easier. We use consumer insights, in-depth research and rigorous testing to deliver the best solution to your everyday needs. Whether it's preparing delicious meals and beverages effortlessly, or making your clothes look their best, you can count on the brand that has spent over 100 years creating products with you in mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610FZl1qHHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B07LB7TLG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LB7TLG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LB7TLG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
