window.products.push({"id":854347,"name":"Air Fryer Magnetic Cheat Sheet Set, Air Fryer Accessories included Big Magnet and Small Magnet Cooking Times Chart, Air fryer Magnet Sheet Quick Refer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913zTOZS-gS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♨️ AIR FRYER ACCESSORIES - Each accessories set comes with 2 cooking time cheat sheets for air fryers that include a Big Magnet (10.5 x 6.5\") and a Small Magnet (5 x 5\") that show the Cooking Time, Temperature, and Size of food to take the guesswork out of cooking. ♨️ PREMIUM MAGNET MATERIAL - Our Rareccy magnetic cheat sheets for air fryers are made of three layers of composite film. Laminated film provides protection from spills and scratches allowing for it to be washed and cleaned. Premium magnet material, soft material with strong grip to metallic surface. The good quality of air fryer magnets are waterproof and oil-proof, which can service a long time. ♨️ EASY TO READ - Our air fryer cooking times chart magnets have both clear textual description and vivid food images, most common foods like Vegetables, Frozen Foods, Beef, Chicken that are properly classified and legible print size makes for quick and easy reading at a glance. LARGER font is printed on the small magnet with your most popular Frozen Foods for even easier referencing. ♨️ JUST STICK IT UP - The air fryer cooking times chart sheets feature a magnetic background that allows you to quickly stick them to your fridge or any other magnetic surface in your kitchen. If you don’t have magnetic surface,we also offer 8 pcs double-sided heat resistance tape to help you stick in any place. ♨️ WIDE COMPATIBILITY - This air fryer cookbook was designed to be compatible with many different brand Air Fryer,such as Ninja Air Fryer, Instant Vortex Air Fryer, Cosori Air Fryer Max, Ultrean Air Fryer.They make the perfect addition to any gift box and gift basket for all gifting occasions.If you have any problem, our customer support team is always standby.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913zTOZS-gS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rareccy","source_asin":"B0915ZH4V1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0915ZH4V1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0915ZH4V1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
