window.products.push({"id":854406,"name":"Trademark Innovations Adjustable Bamboo Tub Organizer Tray Bath Caddy, 28\", Tan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517K3zsAxbL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a relaxing bath while reading your favorite book and sipping your favorite beverage. This bamboo tub tray and caddy comes fully equipped to make every bathing experience a pleasure. It measures 28\"L x 1.5\"W x 8.6\"H and the sides extend to 41.5\" to fit most tubs. There is a wine glass holder, book/tablet holder with a waterproof material backing to prevent items from falling in the water and a cell phone tray. Exercise caution when using electronics as they could fall in the water and become unusable. Folds and stores easily. For best results, make sure to dry the tray thoroughly after each use. By Trademark Innovations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517K3zsAxbL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Innovations","source_asin":"B071QWGRWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071QWGRWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071QWGRWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
