window.products.push({"id":854408,"name":"INDAILY Weighted Blanket for Kids,Warm Kids Blankets(36\"x48\", 5lbs),100% Natural Cotton with Premium Glass Beads","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510gnlb7DLL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"The weight of the weighted blanket is generally chosen from 7% to 12% of the body's weight. we have all sizes from adults to children.A Removable Duvet Cover (sold separately) is Highly Recommended for Easier Cleaning. Made of 100% breathable natural cotton and filled with hypo-allergenic, non-toxic, odorless Glass Beads. the blanket which would make it cooler and more durable, soft and skin-friendly than normal blanket. The heavy blanket is designed to hug you back at night, closely mimicking how a parent cradles their child while they sleep. However, It isn’t just for sleep. It can be used while you’re reading in bed, as you relax on your couch, or while you meditate. To help keep cool in the summer months! The Blanket materials are breathable and you can use the blanket on its own (without the cover) in the summer months as it is designed for weight, not warmth. Note: Children under 5 years old and pregnant women are not recommended. Ensure Old people and Physically weak people can open the weighted blanket independently.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510gnlb7DLL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INDAILY","source_asin":"B07G9NF3ZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G9NF3ZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G9NF3ZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":854409,"name":"Contour Pillow included with Twin XL 2 Inch Soft Sleeper 5.5 Visco Elastic Memory Foam Mattress Topper USA Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":252.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91glJ0vmJyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft Sleeper 5.5 has found a way to give you the same great sleep surface as a $5,000 visco-elastic foam mattress for a price starting at 94% less the cost of a traditional visco foam mattress that sell at some retailers for over $5,000! There is a revolution going on in bedrooms across the country. The revolution is not between the sheets...it's under them! Visco-Elastic memory foam uses a technology first developed by NASA to make the most comfort sleep surface ever. We have taken that technology and developed a luxurious Soft Sleeper 5.5 next generation material. You may have seen the visco-foam mattress story on TV but the secret is that only the top 2-4 inches of their $5,000 mattress is actually the technologically advanced visco-elastic memory foam. The Soft Sleeper 5.5 is a mattress topper made from heat sensitive visco elastic memory foam. This luxurious material reacts to your body temperature, so the surface stays cool in the summer and warm in the winter. Over 9 out of 10 of our customers report that the contoured surface cradles their body and helps eliminate those pressure points created by traditional mattress surfaces. Another 89% of our customers reported less back and neck pain too. When it comes to buying memory foam mattress toppers, there are many options that need to be considered. Many retailers will offer a variety of mattress densities and thicknesses. We however only offer the softest and most luxurious Soft Sleeper series in 2, 3 and 4 inch thicknesses. We are so sure that our Soft Sleeper 5.5 products will improve the one third of your life that is spent in bed that we will offer you a no questions asked in home trial for 30 nights. If you are not sleeping significantly better and waking refreshed, send the mattress topper back for a full refund of the purchase price.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91glJ0vmJyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soft Sleeper Visco Elastic Memory Foam","source_asin":"B07CKNZKRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CKNZKRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CKNZKRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
