window.products.push({"id":854594,"name":"Yair Emanuel Stainless Steel Kiddush Cup with Matching Tray For Shabbat and Havdalah - Accentuated with Pomegranate Design - Judaica Shabbos and Holid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NAVeZpSCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Kiddush cup is a beautifully designed wine goblet used for the blessing before the Shabbat meal. It is more sophisticated than an ordinary wine glass or cup. Throughout generations, the kiddush cup has symbolized the sanctity and spirituality of the Shabbat and Jewish holidays. It defines tradition, holiness and unity in the Jewish home. Enhance your Shabbat table with this stunning Yair Emanuel kiddush cup and tray. It is crafted from high-quality stainless steel and is adorned with a beautiful pomegranate design. It's designed by the famous Artist Yair Emanuel. At the start and end of Shabbat and holidays, Jewish families the world over gather and sanctify the day with a blessing over a cup of wine or grape juice. This elegant, decorative silver cup is perfect for this Jewish tradition. This Yair Emanuel Kiddush Cup has the traditional look used by Jews at the Shabbos meals. Made of high-quality stainless steel, this goblet can be used whenever Jewish tradition calls for reciting a blessing over a cup of wine – be it sanctifying Shabbat, a holiday, or at weddings or a bris. This Kiddush cup would add beauty and sanctity to any family table, and are perfect for Synagogue use too. It's a awesome gift for a groom at a Jewish wedding or even for a Bar Mitzvah boy. Package includes: 1 x Pomegranate design Stainless Steel Kiddush Cup 1 x Maching Tray Product Features: - Dimensions: 5\" x 3.5\" - Color: Silver - Material: High Quality Stainless steel - Durable and Sturdy. - Beautiful Pomegranate Design - Size Meets Halachic Requirements - Great Size for Use on Passover for 4 Cups of Wine - Makes perfect Host/Hostess or Bar Mitzvah and Wedding Gift","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NAVeZpSCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yair Emanuel","source_asin":"B083BX2NKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083BX2NKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083BX2NKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
