window.products.push({"id":854655,"name":"Pure Beeswax Wrap & Food Cover-Holds for Up to a Year, Food storage Set(lemon) Reusable Washable Silicone Stretch lids and Ziplock Silicone Food Stora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eJzhyIA0L._AC_SL1471_.jpg","description":"A Complete Ecofriendly Set to Keep Your Food Fresh Tired of those single- use kitchen plastics for food storage? It’s time to update your food storing ways. Keeping in mind the demand we have designed a complete ecofriendly food storage set to help you keep your food fresh for longer time without the use of that toxic plastic. 15 Pack Food Storage Set Includes: 1 Small Bees Wax Wrap (8\" X 8\") 1 Medium Bees Wax Wrap (11” x 11\") 1 Large Bees Wax Wrap (14” x 14”) 6 Silicone Stretch Lids (2.5/3.5/4.5/5.5/6/7.5 inches) 2 Large Food Storage Bags(1500 mL /50 oz) 4 Medium Ziploc Storage Bags(1000 mL / 30 oz) Perfect for Outdoor Eating Whether you are enjoying a picnic or just having lunch outside this food wrapping set will help you keep both the taste and food safe to make sure you enjoy the food even when you are outside These Organic Bees Wax Paper Wraps are perfect for use on Picnics, for Packed Lunches, wrapping jars, bowls, leftovers, biscuits, cheese wrap, sandwich wrap, Jam, Jars or preserves. In short the list is endless for the bees wrap storage! Silicone Stretch Lids The airtight lids and the silicone food storage bags added in the package will help you keep your food safe and tasty even for a longer time. Non slip silicon lids added are stretchable enough to fit on mugs, bowls, pots & cups. You will never have to ask the annoying question, “where is the lid for this container?” Ziploc Bags Moreover we have also included reusable Ziploc bags in the package to make carrying the food outside easy for you. High quality Seal used in the silicone bags will help you keep food fresh for long time. Buy this beeswax wrap set now to Keep your meals & vegetables fresher than ever!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eJzhyIA0L._AC_SL1471_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Good Life Shack","source_asin":"B07ZK4SK96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZK4SK96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZK4SK96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
