window.products.push({"id":854783,"name":"WoDBiut 2 Packs 6-Cavity Semi Sphere Silicone Mold,Baking Mold for Making Hot Chocolate Bomb, Cake, Jelly, Dome Mousse,Handmade Soap,Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718UpgiVD9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 Pack Large 6-Cavity Semi Sphere Silicone Mold, Baking Mold for Making Hot Chocolate Bomb, Cake, Jelly, Dome Mousse NOTES: 1. When baking, it' s better to put the mould in the flat baking tray as the silicone mould is soft. 2. After use, please clean it using hot water with dilute edible cleaning agent or put in dishwasher. DO NOT use aggressive cleaning agents or foam cleaning force. Ensure that the silicone moulds are dry before storage. 3. After baking, please remove the moulds out of the oven, and place in the baking rack until the moulds completely cooled. 4. Silicone moulds can only be used for oven, microwave ovens, and DO not use in gas and fire.. 5. Do not use knives or other sharp tolls on silicone moulds and avoid stress, pull.. 6. Please do not use cool water to clean immediately when it's just taken out of the oven. Just to extend the service life. size of dome silicone mold Frequently problem answer 1.-Question: I have used this product 3 times and few \"dimples\" are already starting to tear away from the base. -Answer: The mould may be stored quite a while and has been pressed down, and shapes changed. Please place it under the sun or place in oven or place in a high temperature. The shape then will be restored. 2. -Question: Please let me know the temperature of the mould can suffer. -Answer: In general practice, can suffer within the temperature between -40~220 centigrade, in some case can suffer 260 centigrade. Please note silicone mould, which can suffer temperature higher than 260 centigrade (500 degrees fahrenheit) or temperature lower than -40 centigrade (-40 degrees fahrenheit), may be additive, is not 100% pure silicone. 3. -Question: Why the mould soft a bit? -Answer: For flexible reason, we design the mould a bit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718UpgiVD9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WoDBiut","source_asin":"B08RJP2CC7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RJP2CC7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RJP2CC7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
