window.products.push({"id":854798,"name":"LAGHCAT Cooling Blankets, Queen Size Cold Throw Blanket, Double Sided Cold Feeling Fabric Cool and Breathable Can Keep You Cool in Summer, Very Suitab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719CjkrQjVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Double-Sided Cooling Fabric - One side is made of 100% cold fabric printed with geometric elements, and the other side is made of Polyethylene and Nylon combination, coolness value (Q-max) of more than 0.44, which can quickly evaporate the heat generated by the body and transfer cool air to the surface of the body, perfect for sultry days. It and Soft and skin-friendly, suitable for everyone. Comfortable and breathable - Cool blankets are ideal for hot sleepers. It is breathable, soft, and comfortable. Good air permeability can effectively transfer the hot and humid air in the blanket to the outside of the blanket so that you can sleep comfortably all night. If you are surrounded by family and friends who are often troubled by night sweats and can't sleep well, this blanket is undoubtedly the best gift. High quality cold fabric - In hot summer, when you take out our cooling blankets and cover it, which can quickly transfer sweat from the skin to the surface of the fabric and quickly evaporate; When you sleep or take a lunch break, you won't feel hot until you wake up. Even in the hottest season, it can keep you cool and comfortable and have a perfect experience. All-Purpose - It is suitable for bed and sofa at home. It can not only bring good sleep but also decorate your home with geometric elements on the other side. Of course, this blanket is not only suitable for indoor use, but also for any outdoor scene you want to use, for camping, for travel, in the car, or on airplanes. Easy care - Machine washable, Wash in cold water. Because the blanket is made of special cold materials, high-temperature drying may affect the cooling effect of the blanket, so please choose to dry in a cool place or low-temperature drying, In order to keep it cool all the time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719CjkrQjVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAGHCAT","source_asin":"B09VXL4JH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VXL4JH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VXL4JH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
