window.products.push({"id":854836,"name":"Watermelon Slicer Cutter Stainless Steel Windmill Watermelon Cutter Knife - Kids Fascinated Melon Cuber Cutting Tool - Carving and Cutting Utility Kni","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fcbey9YUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to make life convenient and interesting? Especially for a gigantic watermelon in front of you. This is the revolutionary product for the Kitchen Gadgets. It is time to transform the old fashioned cutting way with a knife for your watermelon/melon，when we prepare for a vegetable fruit salad party. This melon cutter tong supplies are awesome! Children are fascinated by it, like to watch watermelon, melon and cantaloupes carving smoothly into nice little cubes one by one, just like an automatic digger. As you can see how beautiful you can make treats for your guest and your kids. Maybe, kids will want to eat many pieces of watermelons. We feel happy when kids eat a nutritious diet. Perfect slicer, So easy to use and it makes a super special treat, making beautiful things so that our guest is happy and intrigued.With OKMIMI Melon’s Stainless Steel Watermelon Slicer, you get evenly cut cube melon in a matter of seconds! No more removing the watermelon or melon from its rind or uneven cutting slices through the fruit. With this remarkable find, all you need to do to enjoy it is to push the tools gently, the windmill starts to turn, and then the beautiful watermelon pieces are cutted out, and you can get a lot of watermelon pieces in a short time. If you have this slicers for fruits and vegetables tools in the kitchen, We recommend that you use it with watermelon baller scoop , you can enjoy most kind of the melons in a creative way and can get lovely compliments from people whom you will serve them. We look forward to your sharing of the experience and mood of using this fruit slicer set, must have cool kitchen gadgets.Grade gifts for women/mom, Kitchen essentials in Summer ,So cool stuff. In order to prevent the stainless steel from being scratched, a protective film is added,Remove the scratched film, it can be used normally.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fcbey9YUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"watermelon slicer pro","source_asin":"B07S7CDFCF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S7CDFCF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S7CDFCF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
