window.products.push({"id":854968,"name":"MAIAGO Halloween Decorations - Boo & Spooky Halloween Porch Sign Banners - Halloween Party Supplies for Outdoor/Indoor Home Front Door Wall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fU8WW1J6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎃 Perfect Halloween Decoration Signs - \"BOO\" Banner, \"SPOOKY\" Banner. This porch sign set unique designed for halloween event and brings you impressive moment with your family & friends. 💀 Unique Design for Halloween Party - The porch sign with features ghosts, pumpkin, spiders, bats, hats, tombstones, skulls, eyeball and etc. They are amazing to boost atmosphere for Halloween party and can be easily hung on the wall or door with ribbon. Great for Halloween photo booth backdrop for taking picture. Will create a impressive Halloween party day. 👿 Great Size - The Halloween hanging sign is 13.7 x 71.6inch / 35 x 182cm. The bottom of each banner has grommets in the corners and can be attaching some weights on allow protect from banners being blown away by the wind and keep straight. 🐱 Quality Craftsmanship - These Halloween porch signs are made of 600D oxford fabric which is sturdy enough. With vibrant colors and visible letters printed, it will be a real eye opener for halloween decoration. It is different from other inferior fabrics and printing techniques. Not easy to break or fade, waterproof and corrosion resistance, can be kept well under bad weather. 👻 No Risk Purchase Guarantee - MAIAGO's 7*24 online support. Your experience with the products is our guideline. If any concerns, send us a message and we will get to you in 2 HOURS. If you're unsatisfied with this item for any reason, we'll immediately send you a replacement or refund your purchase price. No questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fU8WW1J6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAIAGO","source_asin":"B08BYGWNXN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BYGWNXN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BYGWNXN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":854969,"name":"Le Creuset Enameled Cast-Iron Panini Press and Skillet Grill, Black Onyx","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p+BHldJCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Delivering even heat on the top and bottom, this 10-1/4-inch square skillet grill with a 9-inch ribbed press makes it simple to prepare delicious, cafe-style hot sandwiches, paninis, and melts--complete with authentic grill marks on both sides. The grill pan features raised ridges that not only impart tasty grill marks, but they also help drain away excess fat and grease for healthier results. Because it's made of cast iron, the two-piece set requires only a low to medium heat setting, making stovetop coking more economical. Another thoughtful detail include its dual spouts for nondrip pouring--one on each side to accommodate both right- and left-handed users. Like other pieces in Le Creuset's line of enameled cast iron, the cookware's exterior features a colorful, long-lasting enamel that resists chipping and cracking, while its interior provides a satin black enamel--no need to season the cookware in the oven before use. As cast iron is unexcelled for even heat distribution and superior heat retention, and enamel is impervious to acids and odors, the grill cooks food uniformly and gently without hot spots and can be used for cooking on the stovetop or finishing in the oven. The cookware also provides a strong iron handle with an opposite helper handle for a steady grip, and it can be safely used at any oven temperature, under the broiler, and on any stovetop, including induction (the panini press with its phenolic handle is oven-safe up to 350 degrees F). Beautiful enough for the table yet durable enough to outlive its lifetime limited warranty, the cookware brings joie de vivre to any kitchen it graces and should be hand washed for best results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p+BHldJCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B003IPD38K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-854969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003IPD38K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003IPD38K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
